AB  - Pulmonary alveolar proteinosis is a rare condition characterized by progressive 
      accumulation of surfactant lipoproteins in the alveolar space, leading to poor 
      gas exchange. We describe our technique of whole lung lavage for management of 
      pulmonary alveolar proteinosis.
