TI  - Inhaled molgramostim therapy for the treatment of autoimmune pulmonary alveolar 
      proteinosis (aPAP): a plain language summary of the IMPALA trial.
PG  - 47-63
LID - 10.1080/21548331.2024.2367955 [doi]
FAU - Trapnell, Bruce C
AU  - Trapnell BC
AD  - Translational Pulmonary Science Center, Cincinnati Children's Hospital Medical 
      Center, Cincinnati, OH, USA.
